    {
      "source": "A custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/HandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerMapping</code></a> that makes <a href=\"../../../../actuate/endpoint/web/ExposableWebEndpoint.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>web endpoints</code></a>\navailable over HTTP using Spring MVC.",
